@baseUrl = http://localhost:8097

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/health

### Swagger UI
GET {{baseUrl}}/swagger-ui/index.html

### Create a product (sync indexing on create when OPENAI_ENABLED=true)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sku": "SKU-0001",
  "name": "Premium Wireless Headphones",
  "description": "Noise-cancelling over-ear headphones with 30h battery life. Great for travel and office use.",
  "category": "Headphones",
  "tags": "wireless,noise-cancelling,audio",
  "price": 199.99,
  "currency": "USD",
  "inStockQty": 25
}

### Create another product
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sku": "SKU-0002",
  "name": "Compact Mechanical Keyboard",
  "description": "65% mechanical keyboard with hot-swappable switches and Bluetooth connectivity.",
  "category": "Keyboards",
  "tags": "mechanical,compact,bluetooth",
  "price": 129.00,
  "currency": "USD",
  "inStockQty": 40
}

### Search products (vector search)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products/search?q=wireless%20headphones&limit=5&threshold=0.3

### Runtime vector probe (raw AI Fabric search evidence, useful for pushed data-sync records)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/runtime/vector-search?vectorSpace=product&q=wireless%20headphones&limit=5&threshold=0

### Chat (RAG) - requires OPENAI_ENABLED=true + OPENAI_API_KEY
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/chat/query
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "user-1",
  "sessionId": "user-1-session",
  "conversationId": "chat-user-1",
  "position": "landing",
  "query": "I'm looking for wireless headphones under $250. Recommend options from the catalog and explain briefly."
}

### Chat (RAG deep) - forces navigator_deep (ignore position routing)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/chat/query
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "user-1",
  "sessionId": "user-1-session",
  "conversationId": "chat-user-1",
  "mode": "navigator_deep",
  "query": "I need deep info: show alternatives, common complaints, and any related policies for returns."
}

### Chat (ACTION) create purchase order - requires OPENAI_ENABLED=true + OPENAI_API_KEY
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/chat/query
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "user-1",
  "sessionId": "user-1-session",
  "conversationId": "chat-user-1",
  "position": "cart",
  "query": "Create a purchase order for sku SKU-0001 quantity 2, ship to 1 Market St, San Francisco, CA 94105, email alice@example.com."
}

### Chat (EXECUTOR) policy lookup - executor restricts retrieval to allowlisted vectorSpace(s)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/chat/query
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "user-1",
  "sessionId": "user-1-session",
  "conversationId": "chat-user-1",
  "mode": "executor",
  "query": "What is the refund policy?"
}

### Chat (ACTION) add to cart using attachments (deterministic target resolution)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/chat/query
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "user-1",
  "sessionId": "user-1-session",
  "conversationId": "chat-user-1",
  "position": "cart",
  "query": "Add it to my cart",
  "attachments": [
    {
      "id": "SKU-0002",
      "vectorSpace": "product",
      "contentText": "Compact Mechanical Keyboard - 65% mechanical keyboard with Bluetooth connectivity.",
      "metadata": {
        "sku": "SKU-0002",
        "category": "Keyboards"
      },
      "source": "ui-card"
    }
  ]
}

### List orders for the user
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders?userId=user-1

### Inspect stored conversation (ownerId = userId when authenticated)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/chat/conversations/chat-user-1?ownerId=user-1
